      "assessment": "s0195 explicitly names Pei Jinghui and states he is son-in-law (婿) to Wang Lin’s elder brother Min (琳兄珉之婿). That supports p071’s kinship to p072 and entails a marriage existed, but no Chinese unit quotes the daughter or uses 珉之女 / 裴景暉妻 as a referring expression. The descriptive-kinship person p073 is an inferred placeholder, not a primary name witness."
    }
